OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over crash in which
OL,4,Afour-year-old boy died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 28-year-old man has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with a crash in which a
OL,8,Ffour-year-old boy died.
OL,10,FThe crash, which involved a single
OL,11,Fvehicle, happened on Drumcross Road in
OL,12,FBathgate, between Limefield Road and
OL,13,FDrumcross Farm, at about 16:30 on
OL,14,FFriday 6 November.
OL,16,FThe boy was taken by ambulance to St
OL,17,FJohn's Hospital in Livingston, where he
OL,18,Fdied a short time later. The
OL,19,F28-year-old driver of the Black Range
OL,20,FRover was taken to hospital for
OL,21,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
